  dialogueText: "Welcome to my workshop! I am weaving abel cloth. In Ilokano, to weave is agabel. To walk is magna. To eat is mangan. These words describe what we do every day."
  translatedText: "I am weaving. To weave is agabel. To walk is magna. To eat is mangan."
